  "details": "Finally just realised why my imposters kept failing, here's what I found.\n\nAn avatar with a PC and android version uploaded generate imposters just fine. If you attempt to generate an imposter for an avatar with a PC, android and iOS version, a failure message will be displayed in game after a few minutes.\n\nI was unaware android avatars would auto convert and display on iOS, so was uploading an iOS avatar identical to the android one. Doing this broke imposter generation. Deleting and re-uploading the avatar without the iOS version successfully generated imposters.\n\nI kinda think this is not supposed to happen so here we are",
